1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,000
Telegramdagi o'g'lingizning ovoziga ko'r-ko'rona ishonmang.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,100
AI uni nusxalay oladi.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,900
«Men uning yuzini, ovozini, odatlarini bilaman.»

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
«Oyi, tez pul tashlang, keyin tushuntiraman.»

5
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:27,000
Lekin ona bitta savol yozdi.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,800
Nusxa javob topa olmadi.

7
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:41,000
AI yuzni va ovozni nusxalaydi.

8
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:45,400
Lekin xotira va mehrni nusxalay olmaydi.

9
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:50,600
Oilangiz bilan bitta maxfiy so'z kelishib qo'ying.

